flowchart LR
    Scheduler[Health check scheduler] --> API[Operations health API]
    API --> Control[(Control-plane database)]
    API --> Tenant[(Tenant database pool)]
    API --> Redis[(Redis/BullMQ)]
    API --> Storage[(Object storage)]
    API --> Provider[Payment/courier/messaging providers]
    API --> Backup[Backup evidence inventory]

    Control --> Normalize[Normalize status and latency]
    Tenant --> Normalize
    Redis --> Normalize
    Storage --> Normalize
    Provider --> Normalize
    Backup --> Normalize
    Normalize --> Threshold{Healthy within threshold?}
    Threshold -- yes --> Dashboard[Operator dashboard]
    Threshold -- no --> Alert[Sanitized alert and incident record]
    Alert --> Dashboard
    Dashboard --> Audit[Audit evidence and follow-up]

    Note1[Health checks must avoid secrets and customer data.] -.-> Normalize
    Note2[Provider unavailable does not imply tenant database failure.] -.-> Threshold